Subject: [PATCH] target/dadao: generalize precise CFX carrier (KL-122a)

---
 target/dadao/cpu.c    | 110 ++++++++++++++++++-------------------
 target/dadao/cpu.h    |  33 +++--------
 target/dadao/helper.c | 125 ++++++++++--------------------------------
 3 files changed, 93 insertions(+), 175 deletions(-)

diff --git a/target/dadao/cpu.c b/target/dadao/cpu.c
